function verifyPrompt(finding, lens) {
  return `You are a skeptical verifier checking ONE claimed defect in a pre-execution review of ${PLAN_PATH}, a Swift monorepo remediation plan (the-record-suite). A prior reviewer (lens: ${lens.label}) claimed:

