Default to real=false (refuted) if you cannot independently confirm the defect is genuine and would actually change what should be written in the plan. Only set real=true if you positively confirm the defect yourself, independent of the prior reviewer's say-so.`
}

function synthesisPrompt(confirmed) {
  return `You are finalizing an adversarial pre-mortem review of ${PLAN_PATH}, a 7-wave, ~35-packet Swift remediation plan (the-record-suite monorepo) that has NOT started execution yet. A fleet of adversarial reviewers found the following CONFIRMED planning defects (each independently verified by a skeptic who tried to refute it and failed):

